WEBVTT

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.250
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:22.940
You’re such a bad monster! You started destroying the city right after you appeared!

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:23.710
In that case…

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:28.620
I will serve you until you’re sick (of me) ~Nya!

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.630
It’s Mew Mew! How cute!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.530
Really?

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.790
Yeah, you’re cute!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.520
I will serve you! ~Nya!

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:46.940
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:54.150
Justice prevails once more! ~Nya!

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:56.440
Momomiya-san!

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.730
Aoyama-kun, how did you?..

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:00.860
Momomiya-san.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.830
I didn’t know you were a girl like this.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:04.790
EHhhhhhh!?

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:06.070
You…

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.250
are like…

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.710
wearing such a frilly dress…

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:12.450
nya?

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:14.170
…and putting on soft wars and a tail!

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:14.580
nya nya?

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.870
…and fighting bad monsters!..

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:17.640
nya nya!?

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.140
I didn’t know you were such a girl!

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:21.310
Aoyama-kun!

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:24.630
No, wait. This isn’t me!

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.150
No, it’s not like what you think!

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.700
And what’s “not like
what I think”? Momomiya-san?

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:39.660
I’m sorry.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.170
But that was one amazing sleep talk.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.950
Huh? Did I talk that much?

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:51.610
Yup!

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:54.870
You were screaming… roaring… and suddenly saying “NO!”

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:56.240
The teacher didn’t know what to do.

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:58.130
Yeah, everyone was surprised.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.870
I guess those are acceptable…
Wait. What if I said…

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.250
“I’ll serve for you!” ~Nya!

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.390
I heard something like that.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:05.940
What?!

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.670
Yeah, it was something like that.

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:08.300
That sounded just like her!

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.210
Wasn’t she cute?

00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:11.580
The blue girl was cute…

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:13.430
The purple one was good!

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.230
Seems like we’re the topic of the day…

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:15.230
The yellow one!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.660
The five of us are…

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:23.530
The protectors of justice,
Tokyo Mew Mew!

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:27.110
Although I did it on impulse,
maybe I overdid it?

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:30.330
Stupid stupid stupid, I’m stupid!

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.950
The red girl in the middle stood out the most, right?

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:34.530
Yeah, the girl with the cat ears.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:37.600
She was valiant! I’m a fan of hers!

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.510
What are you smirking about, Ichigo?

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:41.250
What are you talking about?

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.620
I’m not smirking.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.580
She is, right?

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.220
Yeah.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.090
No, I’m not.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:45.830
You are.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.670
Yes.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.370
No, I’m not.

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.520
Weirdo.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.210
Bye!

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.400
See you tomorrow!

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.560
Yep, bye!

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:03.890
It seems the say ended safely… but I need to go work at the store.

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:06.280
I hate this lifestyle.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:10.440
I haven’t talked with Aoyama-kun lately too.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.040
Momomiya-san.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.150
YES?!

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.440
Sorry, did I surprise you?

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.200
No… not at all.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.450
I saw you here, so…
are you going home?

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:19.580
Yeah.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.120
What about you, Aoyama-kun?

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:24.550
Yeah, I need to visit
Inohara Park later…

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:30.010
Are you in a hurry?

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.460
If you have the time…

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:38.390
Yes, I’m bored. Very bored!
I have nothing to do!

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:41.780
Then I think I’ll take you with me.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:45.730
We’re almost there. Watch your step.

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.940
Okay, I’m fine, thanks.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.770
This sure is a weird place.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:52.110
I wonder how far Aoyama-kun is going.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:57.250
Wait, are we going somewhere where there’s less people?

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:01.870
But, wait, no, my heart’s
beating faster…

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:07.130
Please stop. If my heard starts to pound like this… I… I…

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:11.130
We’re here.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:11.930
This place…

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.960
Momomiya-san?

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:19.150
Hahaha. It’s nothing! I just dropped something… wait, err…

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:22.700
Okay, it was just my imagination.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.070
How beautiful!

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:32.650
Why this place only? It’s only June.

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:34.830
Yes, isn’t is weird?

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:39.790
A college sent an investigation team here too,

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:45.040
but they don’t know what’s causing this phenomenon.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.880
By the way, listen.
It’s going to start to chirp.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:56.940
Are these, cicadas?

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.010
Yeah.

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:01.650
There’s one cicada in this
tree somewhere.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.860
Oh? This one can’t wait till the summer, it seems.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.350
Momomiya-san.

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.310
Yes?

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:11.580
Do you know why a cicada chirps?

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:14.520
Um… I…

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.900
To call for a female cicada?

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.650
Yep. That’s right.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:25.220
I think it woke up early because of the same reason as this cherry tree.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:30.990
But it’s continuing to call for another since he doesn’t know that.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:34.300
It’s saying, “I’m here.”

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.550
Even when there’s no one
who will listen to him.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.350
He’s going to continue and call for another and…

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:45.650
Sorry for talking so much.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.610
No, I enjoyed the chat.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:56.520
Since you accompanied me on my visit here, I’m yours for the rest of the day.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.080
What?

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:59.080
Let’s go somewhere together…

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:00.580
…shall we?

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.040
Okay!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.530
May I order?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.900
Yes, coming!..

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.340
A glass of water please!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:07.330
Right away!

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.340
Why are you smirking, Ichigo-oneechan?

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:11.620
What are you talking about, Bu-Ling?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.870
I’m not smirking.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.870
May I order?

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:15.840
Yes, coming!..

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.520
Did something good happen?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.460
We will have her work extra hours to make up for being late.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.520
I got more tired than usual.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.400
You speak as if you work all the time…

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.190
Retasu…

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:32.530
What did you mean by that?

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.500
Care to explain that to me?

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.900
I’m sorry I’m sorry I’m sorry.
Please forgive me!..

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:44.630
Why’re you acting that way? I only wanted to hear what you meant by that statement.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:41.650
Bu-Ling will…

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:42.990
May I order?

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:44.630
Yep, coming!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.530
I just said the real thing!..

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.370
The real thing?!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.780
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.510
Yes?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.470
Zakuro-san is ready.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.790
Zakuro-san, you look nice in anything!

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.550
Oneesama, you look wonderful!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:04.630
In this case Zakuro-san… please take this to the back table.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:05.520
Sure.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:08.740
But won’t we gather
unwanted attention

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.680
if people find out that a celebrity like Zakuro works here?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.240
Oh, that won’t be a problem.

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:18.940
This is your special fruit tart.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:19.820
O-Okay!

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:21.650
Enjoy.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:22.880
Thank you…

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.240
Zakuro-san has a more cheerful image in showbiz,

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:30.870
so no one will guess that she’s the same unsociable waitress here.

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:34.620
That’s nice but being unsociable is… bad for business.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.000
I guess it means I have
to work harder!

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:37.850
Geez.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.760
I’m tired…

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:45.310
Good job, everyone.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:48.480
You all must be hungry. Let’s have tea.

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:51.680
Woww! How cute!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.720
Are these us?

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:54.770
It’s to celebrate all five of us
gathering together.

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:56.810
Hey, Keiichirou!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:58.500
I told you to do that later.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.940
If you mean like that, I’m not going to give you your share, Shirogane.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:02.950
I don’t need any.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.950
I have something to talk about. Come to the basement.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:08.610
We were just about to celebrate…

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.090
It’s because all five have gathered.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.580
The real fight begins here.

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:16.800
The enemy is going to get serious. Prepare yourselves.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:23.510
It’s about time?

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:33.610
I wanted to play with her longer… but I guess it’s good bye, dear kitten.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.290
What is this place?

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.500
I told you before. It’s a secret base.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.460
Shirogane…

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:54.680
And what are you planning to do here?

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:59.510
I wanted to make the situation we’re in clear now that all five are gathered.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.770
The Earth is being targeted.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:06.180
The bad influences to the animals coming from the destruction of the environment

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:08.830
isn’t something that began just recently.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:12.320
However, we started receiving weird data a while ago.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.280
Weird… data?

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.280
Yes.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:20.000
We came to a conclusion after doing a long research…

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:26.010
Someone is cooperating in the destruction of the environment.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.000
Furthermore…

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.750
It uses an advanced technology that is still undiscovered here at Earth.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.960
Alien?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:36.560
They are trying to recreate the Earth to their advantage.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:41.190
They don’t care if the animals living on this planet become extinct.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:46.600
No, that might be their true purpose.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:47.900
Most of those are suppositions.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.320
There’s one thing we’re sure of…

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.870
…If we don’t stop the aliens now,

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:58.410
there will be no future for the animals living on this planet.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.370
How can you be so sure about that?

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:03.690
The final thing that convinced me of this, is you all.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:04.580
Us?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:05.250
Yes.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.970
The Grey Wolf, Zakuro.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.050
The Golden Lion Tamarin, Bu-Ling.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.300
The Finless Porpoise, Retasu.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.640
The Tahiti Blue Lory, Minto.

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:20.810
And the Iriomote Wild Cat, Ichigo.

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.830
The fact that five people who can convert the Red Data animals’ power…

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:29.320
…are brought together by fate to fight the enemy, convinced me…

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.320
I don’t believe in coincidences.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.780
But aren’t you the one who chose us, Shirogane-san?

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:38.910
No.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:42.380
We… simply just found you all.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:46.420
If there is a person who chose you,

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:48.960
it must be…

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.260
Me! Me! Me! I have a question!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:03.470
You sure don’t know
when to get serious.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:08.540
I understand why we have to fight, but how long do we have to fight?

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:08.980
Huh?

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:13.570
You told us that our body is going to stay like this till the fight ends…

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:16.700
that my ears will continue to poke out when I get excited…

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:19.780
So I’m asking, when is the fight going to end?

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.450
I told you, after you defeat
all the aliens.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.460
So when is that?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.500
How should I know?

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.610
What?!

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.370
That ends my speech.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:31.620
Let’s go eat some cake!

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:37.420
I’m having trouble with this…

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.550
I really am…

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.970
Ichigo-oneechan…

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.100
Ichigo-san…

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:44.940
You must have someone you like.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.560
Um… well…

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:53.520
If you want to experience real love, you can’t be the only one who gets excited.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:58.660
You have to make the other person get excited as well. Right?

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.290
Huh… oneesama!

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.280
No fair, Ichigo!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:07.370
You pretended to be having trouble and got Zakuro to be kind to you!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.870
We’re having trouble with this as well! Right, Retasu?

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.830
Trouble?.. What’s a Finless Porpoise?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.330
A type of dolphin!

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.500
Bu-Ling’s power is a lion!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:16.290
It’s a monkey!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.170
But he said lion.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.300
It’s just a freaking monkey, monkey, monkey, MONKEY!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.590
Why do you have to get mad?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.930
What kind of power does
a dolphin have?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.300
I don’t know!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.270
Protect the Earth, huh?

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:34.810
The story is too out-of-scale to believe. Right, Masha?

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:36.820
To believe. To believe.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:41.790
And Aoyama-kun finally invited me to go somewhere…

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:48.460
We’re not going out together, but this must be a date, right?

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:54.220
If we end up being alone together, could we… maybe…

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.970
I hate this!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.970
What is it, Ichigo?

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.840
Dad, no, don’t come in!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.940
What did you say to your dad?!

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:07.100
NO!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:10.730
I’m leaving!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:12.350
Be careful!

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:17.820
Damn it, Ichigo acted like nothing happened. I’m hurt.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:21.370
It’s because you tried
to get into a girl’s room.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.030
Today, I’m going to do my best!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.200
Do my best, do my best!

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.780
Yeah, there’s no point in
worrying about it.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:33.620
I was alone at the beginning,
but I was able to find my friends.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.410
And things are going well
with Aoyama-kun…

00:13:37.590 --> 00:13:40.500
Everything should go well
if I do my best.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.390
It should…

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.350
It should!

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.510
What’s the matter, Keiichirou?

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.020
Please look at this.

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:53.180
This is the atmosphere composition around here.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.060
This is the data for this week.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:59.290
The very bottom is carbon dioxide. I will extract these and expand its axis.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.110
What’s happening?

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:02.440
It’s the plants.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.860
All the samples had a trace of being tampered with.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.320
The area around the capital is already…

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.330
This doesn’t look good.
What do you think?

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:10.950
They probably used a virus
of some sort.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:15.460
Then there should be a source of the infection.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.340
Give me 30 minutes.
I will isolate the point.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:20.180
Okay.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.880
Hey! We’re going to close now.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.340
Have the customers here leave within 30 minutes as well.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:26.880
What?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.390
Why?

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:29.840
An enemy?

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.800
We’re looking into it.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.610
These plants will…

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:37.350
…begin to spit out extremely poisonous material that will contaminate the air.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.980
They will start this night at the latest.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.270
What did you say?

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:43.240
It’s going to take too much time if we destroy the plants one by one so…

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.610
We’re going to destroy the source.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.070
There are five large trees in the center of this infection.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.530
All five of you willwork independently and destroy these at once.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:51.410
At once?

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.330
Yes.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:54.200
If any one of you is late…

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.670
All the trees and flowers in the city will begin to spit out poison.

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:01.290
Tokyo… will die.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:05.180
The center of these trees is Inohara Park’s cherry tree.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:06.550
For this one…

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.090
I’ll go! I’ve gone there before!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.430
Let me go!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:14.680
Okay.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.740
You all decide on who goes where. I’m counting on you all.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.450
Oh wait, you all have a name now…

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.270
Tokyo Mew Mew! Sortie!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.230
Mew Mew Pomegranate!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.190
Mew Mew Pudding!

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.150
Mew Mew Lettuce!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:28.150
Mew Mew Mint!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.610
Mew Mew Strawberry!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.540
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.660
That should do it.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:24.580
Oh? We have a rare customer here.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.540
Who is it? Is someone here?

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.510
Sleep well forever. Hehh!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:36.910
What’s…

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.390
The flowers will begin to fall away.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.270
A little bit more,
the time is almost ripe.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.540
This voice is… Quiche!?

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.780
So it’s you again!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.620
Hello, Ichigo.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:17:00.080
We meeting here again must mean we are…

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:00.750
Shut up!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:04.080
How could you do something evil like this over and over!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:07.500
I’m going to service you in return!..

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:11.340
Oh wait a minute, I don’t have time to deal with you today. Get out of my way!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:11.960
No.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.310
Tokyo is going to die today.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:19.190
But I’ll kill you with my
own hands, Ichigo.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.440
That’s my last… present to you!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:24.940
What was that?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:25.600
You’re too slow.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.400
This is the end.
Good bye, Mew Strawberry.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.620
Amazing! This is just amazing!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.500
You’re greater than I thought.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.460
I’m moved! You hit me
when I was serious!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.510
Yes, I know…

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:55.420
I’ll ask for your life to be spared.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.770
Let’s go together, Ichigo.

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:06.810
What’s happening?
We were just having fun.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.570
No! It’s a failure!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.980
How about it, Ichigo?

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.120
How about it?

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:20.700
Who’s the one that’s not working?

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.620
Who!..

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:27.840
Everyone…

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.970
What? Ichigo…

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.590
Ichigo!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.020
StrawberBell!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:42.850
Ichigo, stop!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.310
Stop it, Ichigo, you’re going to die!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.320
Ichigo, look this way!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:00.030
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.220
The alien’s life response has disappeared.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.060
It worked!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.800
They really are an amazing
bunch of girls.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:25.560
Right, Ryou?

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:29.770
Yeah…

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.570
See you again, kitten.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:54.890
I’m sorry.

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:05.270
Ichigo?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.520
Ichigo…

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:17.120
This can’t be!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.240
Why?

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:29.820
Ichigo. What do you like about that Aoyama?

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:32.820
I believe I’m a much better man.

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:35.550
You don’t need to get that depressed just because he found out about you.

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:38.970
I would listen to your worries anytime.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.600
I know,

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:43.460
I’ll erase that guy for you.

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:47.500
Then, you wouldn’t have to worry about anything, my honey!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:50.960
Next time: Intersecting Hearts, Aoyama-kun is Targeted.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.820
I’ll serve for Ichigo’s Earth ~Nya!
